{"availability":"available","full":"waynesutton/agent-ready-component","name":"agent-ready-component","description":"A Convex component that auto-generates, caches, and serves llms.txt, agents.md, and llms-full.txt from your Convex backend. Register it with app.use(agentReady), drop the widget into your React or Svelte frontend, and your app is discoverable by AI agents. No external hosting required.","category":"Productivity","language":"JavaScript","stars":9,"forks":2,"created":"2026-04-25T23:22:12Z","updated":"2026-08-28T06:24:54Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://quixotic-viper-800.convex.site/","topics":["agent","ai","aiagent","llms","markdown"],"demo":"https://your-deployment.convex.site/api/auth/callback/github%60","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T16:11:50.491Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T16:11:50.491Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T16:11:50.491Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:32:59.711Z","stars":9,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-04T16:11:50.491Z","stars":9,"forks":2}],"technologies":["React","Svelte"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A Convex component that makes your app readable by AI agents out of the box. Register it with app.use(agentReady) and it generates and serves llms.txt plus a per-site markdown file at your site root, live by default, with ETag caching, Accept: text/markdown content negotiation, and an RFC 8288 Link discovery header on every response. No config file required.","Advanced features are one flag away: agents.md, llms-full.txt, a readiness score endpoint, robots.txt, sitemap.xml, RSS, agent analytics, AI-assisted descriptions, a browsable /markdown site, React, Svelte, and Expo widgets, an AgentLinks footer, and a CLI with an interactive wizard. See Advanced.","Upgrading from 0.2.x? See what's new in 0.3.0 and how to upgrade for the feature comparison and the one wrapper change to make. Existing installs keep their publish state: draft stays draft, live stays live."],"features":["Convex component with isolated tables: your app schema stays untouched","Live by default: llms.txt, agents.md, and the per-site markdown file serve as soon as they generate. Opt into publish: \"draft\" for review-before-publish (deprecated testMode: true still maps to draft)","Per-site /{site-name}.md markdown summary with ETag/304, slug derived from your app name","RFC 8288 Link: ; rel=\"describedby\" header on every component response","AgentLinks footer component for React and Svelte plus a plain HTML snippet"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/waynesutton/agent-ready-component/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"75735aa962f235c4ed1a208e818aeb9bcce78cf2d2a43ff2819a36f3a6708ca7","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:26:19.183Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:47:52.149Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-28T06:24:54Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:47:52.158Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A Convex component that makes your app readable by AI agents out of the box. Register it with app.use(agentReady) and it generates and serves llms.txt plus a per-site markdown file at your site root, live by default, with ETag caching, Accept: text/markdown content negotiation, and an RFC 8288 Link discovery header on every response. No config file required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/waynesutton/agent-ready-component/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"75735aa962f235c4ed1a208e818aeb9bcce78cf2d2a43ff2819a36f3a6708ca7","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/waynesutton/agent-ready-component/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T10:47:52.150Z"},"readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/waynesutton/agent-ready-component/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T10:47:52.152Z","hash":"75735aa962f235c4ed1a208e818aeb9bcce78cf2d2a43ff2819a36f3a6708ca7","originalBytes":39043,"storedBytes":39043,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["convex","agent-ready","true","npx","markdown","widget"